  "title": "Signal Bargain",
  "rules": [
    "Three finite commodities supply private three-good recipes. Free inventory plus escrow capacity is four.",
    "Create one-for-one addressed offers while adjacent and sharing a market neighborhood. A real unit enters escrow.",
    "Expiry rejection and cancellation precede acceptance. Settlement requires both endpoints near stored offer location and adjacent after movement.",
    "TTL starts at five; old TTL one expires before acceptance. New offers cannot settle that same transition.",
    "Signals cost one reward and one of three tokens; roles within radius three receive chosen content, which may be a bluff.",
    "Own-home delivery pays eighteen. Deadlines 42,48,54 deactivate unfinished traders with a three-point penalty."
  ],
